al office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A magnetic tape cartridge in which a single reel on which a magnetic tape is wound is rotatably housed in a cartridge case made up of mutually coupled upper and lower halves (2, 3), and a leader pin (21) for tape leading to which the end of the magnetic tape is secured is provided in recessed parts (28) formed in the upper and lower halves (2, 3), erected with the axis being vertical, locked by the biasing force of a spring member (30) applied to the end parts (21c, 21c) of the leader pin (21), and held detachably in an opening part (26) for tape leading of the cartridge case, wherein a slant face (32) sloping obliquely downward is provided to at least part of a side wall against which the biasing of the spring member (30) provided in the recess (28) in the upper half (2) presses so as to control the leader pin (21) down. The position in the direction of height of the tape leading mechanism on the recording/reproducing apparatus side in which the magnetic tape cartridge is loaded is matched with that of the leader pin (21).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur une cartouche pour bande magnétique faite d'une moitié supérieure et d'une moitié inférieure (2,3) renfermant une bobine unique autour de laquelle s'enroule la bande. La cartouche est munie d'un doigt (21) de guidage vertical de la bande, sur lequel elle repose, logé dans un évidement pratiqué dans les deux moitiés (2, 3) et verrouillé par la force de rappel d'un ressort (30) s'appliquant à ses deux extrémités (21c, 21c), et maintenue réversiblement dans une ouverture (26) pour le guidage de la bande dans la cartouche. Une face oblique (32) inclinée vers le bas est prévue sur au moins une partie de la paroi latérale sur laquelle presse le ressort (30) placé dans l'évidement pour maintenir le doigt de guidage (21) en position basse. La position en hauteur du mécanisme de guidage du côté de l'appareil d'enregistrement/lecture où la cartouche est chargée correspond à celle du doigt (21) de guidage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>